879	# Product Description -- Knowledge Base
880	
881	## What Is This?
882	
883	A desktop application for managing a personal knowledge base. Users import text and Markdown documents, the system indexes them into searchable chunks, and a question-answering interface provides grounded answers with citations.
884	
885	## Core Features
886	
887	### Document Management
888	- Import `.txt` and `.md` files into a local data store.
889	- View document metadata: title, filename, size, import date, indexing status.
890	- Browse a list of all imported documents in a sidebar panel.
891	- Delete documents and their associated data.
892	
893	### Text Indexing
894	- Split documents into ~500-character chunks at paragraph boundaries.
895	- Store chunks with metadata (character count, word count).
896	- Track indexing status per document and overall.
897	- Support indexing individual documents or the full library.
898	
899	### Grounded Q&A
900	- Ask natural language questions about the document library.
901	- Receive answers with citations pointing to specific document chunks.
902	- Confidence scores indicate answer reliability (0.85 with citations, 0.30 without).
903	- Full Q&A history is persisted across sessions.
904	
905	### Status Bar
906	- Real-time display of index status (idle, indexing, ready, error).
907	- Document count and last activity timestamp.
908	
909	## Technical Requirements
910	
911	- Runs as a desktop application via Electron.
912	- No external API dependencies -- all processing is local.
913	- TypeScript throughout with strict mode.
914	- React 18 for the UI with a dark theme.
915	- Data stored locally in the user's application data directory.
916	
917	## User Interface
918	
919	The interface has a three-panel layout:
920	
921	```
922	+------------------+----------------------------------------+
923	| Header           |                                Refresh |
924	+------------------+----------------------------------------+
925	| Document List    | Document Detail / Welcome              |
926	| (sidebar)        |                                        |
927	|                  | Q&A Response                           |
928	| [+ Import]       |                                        |
929	+------------------+----------------------------------------+
930	| Question Input                              [Ask]         |
931	+-----------------------------------------------------------+
932	| Status: idle | Documents: 0                                |
933	+-----------------------------------------------------------+
934	```
935	
936	## Constraints
937	
938	- Maximum supported file size: 10 MB.
939	- Supported formats: `.txt`, `.md`.
940	- Q&A uses mock patterns -- no LLM integration in this version.
941	- All data is local; no network requests.
